  "body_html": "<p>Happy Saturday! Hope you are enjoying the weekend and disconnecting a bit. We had a boring week in the market…but that’s not a bad thing. There is always a “quiet” before the big moves. The market was like this, before yet again, hitting another all time high; despite the negative headlines! </p><p>I have gotten pretty hot on the silver again. One of my best trades of the year, we sold off January 29th, the day before silver crashed -30%, and trended down for ~205 days.  </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ljKc!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffa274a67-f56d-4779-8fa4-ff117c99cc8c_1400x861.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ljKc!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffa274a67-f56d-4779-8fa4-ff117c99cc8c_1400x861.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ljKc!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffa274a67-f56d-4779-8fa4-ff117c99cc8c_1400x861.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ljKc!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffa274a67-f56d-4779-8fa4-ff117c99cc8c_1400x861.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ljKc!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffa274a67-f56d-4779-8fa4-ff117c99cc8c_1400x861.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ljKc!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffa274a67-f56d-4779-8fa4-ff117c99cc8c_1400x861.png\" width=\"1400\" height=\"861\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/fa274a67-f56d-4779-8fa4-ff117c99cc8c_1400x861.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:861,&quot;width&quot;:1400,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:273052,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/212164835?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffa274a67-f56d-4779-8fa4-ff117c99cc8c_1400x861.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ljKc!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffa274a67-f56d-4779-8fa4-ff117c99cc8c_1400x861.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ljKc!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffa274a67-f56d-4779-8fa4-ff117c99cc8c_1400x861.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ljKc!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffa274a67-f56d-4779-8fa4-ff117c99cc8c_1400x861.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ljKc!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffa274a67-f56d-4779-8fa4-ff117c99cc8c_1400x861.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Silver peaking my interest again July 31st. </figcaption></figure></div><p>I talked about silver and other assets this week. If you missed any of these posts, check them out when you have time (you can click them). </p><ul><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/silver-looks-bullish?r=4z8lgl\">Silver Looks Bullish</a> </strong></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/good-news-for-bitcoin-investors?r=4z8lgl\">Good News For Bitcoin Investors</a></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-last-two-stocks-ran-30-and-34\">Mid-Week Movers: #1 Stock of the Week</a></strong></p></li></ul><p>As always, if you ever want to talk more about a ticker, or have questions about why I say some of the things I do on the internet (I know some comments probably make you scratch your head 😅), you are always welcome to swing by the <strong><a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/8aac3321-fed7-4dd4-a536-a9fb92d3e2bb\">Main Chat</a> </strong>during market hours, and we can have a constructive conversation. We have several really good investors and traders in there. Even some lurking Financial Advisors. I’m proud of the collaborative group we have formed, always helping each other. Many people are so much stronger investors today than just a few months or even years ago. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FibG!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0f15b2aa-2d22-49d7-8b9f-41778f82b557_474x158.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FibG!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0f15b2aa-2d22-49d7-8b9f-41778f82b557_474x158.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FibG!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0f15b2aa-2d22-4