2F0f15b2aa-2d22-49d7-8b9f-41778f82b557_474x158.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FibG!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0f15b2aa-2d22-49d7-8b9f-41778f82b557_474x158.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">The internet is better with Millennials 😏</figcaption></figure></div><p>Have a great rest of your weekend, and I will see you Monday! </p><h4>If you like this content, please be sure to ❤️ and 🔁 re-stack. It truly helps fight the AI slop here on Substack. </h4><div class=\"captioned-button-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/silver-breaking-out-what-comes-next?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CaptionedButtonToDOM\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Know someone into investing? Share this post with them!</p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/silver-breaking-out-what-comes-next?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/silver-breaking-out-what-comes-next?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p></div><p></p><div class=\"subscription-widget-wrap-editor\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidgetToDOM\"><div class=\"subscription-widget show-subscribe\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Timothy’s StockTok is a reader-supported publication. To receive new posts and support my work, consider